# Store LF in the repository, check out whatever the machine prefers.
#
# Git on Windows converts to CRLF on checkout, which is fine locally. Without
# this file, though, the first commit from a Linux or macOS contributor can
# rewrite every line of every file, and the diff becomes unreadable — the
# change is invisible inside a wall of whitespace noise.
* text=auto eol=lf
